<title>INDIA: India Colour-Chem 1996/97 net up 27 pct.</title>
<headline>India Colour-Chem 1996/97 net up 27 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	   241.1 vs   190.3</p>
<p>    Total income     3,496.9 vs 3,144.9</p>
<p>    Profit before	331.1 vs   250.3</p>
<p>tax</p>
<p>    Div (in rupees)     60.0 vs    45.0</p>
<p>Note: Colour-Chem Ltd, a subsidiary of Hoechst AG, is a manufacturer of dyes and fine chemicals. The company said it would hold its annual general meeting on August 28. It gave no other details.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
